        </div>


        <div class="undertaking-obligation">

            <span class="undertaking-obligation-label">a.</span>

            <span class="undertaking-obligation-text">
                Hold all Confidential Information in strict confidence and
                use the highest degree of care.
            </span>

        </div>


        <div class="undertaking-obligation">

            <span class="undertaking-obligation-label">b.</span>

            <span class="undertaking-obligation-text">
                Use the Confidential Information solely for the purpose of
                performing his/her duties for the Company and not for any
                personal benefit or for any other purpose.
            </span>

        </div>


        <div class="undertaking-obligation">

            <span class="undertaking-obligation-label">c.</span>

            <span class="undertaking-obligation-text">
                Not disclose, copy, reproduce, transmit, or make available
                any Confidential Information to any third party (including
                family members, friends, or future employers) without the
                prior written consent of the Company.
            </span>

        </div>

    </div>



