                    bond) from a competent court.
                </span>
            </div>


            <div class="undertaking-remedy-item">
                <span class="undertaking-remedy-label">•</span>

                <span class="undertaking-remedy-text">
                    Recovery of all damages, including actual, consequential,
                    and punitive damages, legal fees, and costs.
                </span>
            </div>


            <div class="undertaking-remedy-item">
